(83, 'en', 3, 'accommodations', '{\"title\":\"Cosy flat in the centre\",\"description\":\"A sunny, cosy flat in the centre of Prague. The flat is furnished with modern furniture and provides all the basic amenities for a comfortable stay. The neighbourhood is full of attractions, cafés and restaurants. Excellent transport links, ideal for any trip. Enjoy every moment of city life in this cosy flat.\"}'),
